[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8460.15, "timestamp": "02:21:00", "text": "不知何故，它被命名为“战争雷霆”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8462.469, "timestamp": "02:21:02", "text": "你是通过广告去的吗？因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8464.79, "timestamp": "02:21:04", "text": "这简直就是个广告。那部分被大量添加。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8470.03, "timestamp": "02:21:10", "text": "是的。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8473.19, "timestamp": "02:21:13", "text": "上帝。嗯，是的，我算是他的朋友吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8475.59, "timestamp": "02:21:15", "text": "我的那件事又让我重新沉迷其中，我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8477.55, "timestamp": "02:21:17", "text": "比如，“哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8480.87, "timestamp": "02:21:20", "text": "真有趣。”自从我看了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8483.83, "timestamp": "02:21:23", "text": "《壮志凌云》里，我当时想，“是啊，我应该……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8487.27, "timestamp": "02:21:27", "text": "也应该努力磨练，争取像喷气式飞机一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8495.51, "timestamp": "02:21:35", "text": "是啊，挺好玩的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8498.469, "timestamp": "02:21:38", "text": "你玩过飞行模拟器吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8500.75, "timestamp": "02:21:40", "text": "呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8504.87, "timestamp": "02:21:44", "text": "我还没试过，但你需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8507.51, "timestamp": "02:21:47", "text": "那。我认为它需要很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8510.07, "timestamp": "02:21:50", "text": "是图形，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8512.389, "timestamp": "02:21:52", "text": "是的。嗯，没关系。我的意思是，不是说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8519.349, "timestamp": "02:21:59", "text": "哦，你要买笔记本电脑吗？啊，是的。我"}]